.Dd 2026-06-02
.Dt NOMAD-BUILD-CHECK 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nomad-build-check
.Nd report whether the latest admin image build is ready to pull
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm nomad build-check
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm nomad build-check
reports whether the admin container image
.Pq Li :edge
has finished building for the latest commit on
.Li main ,
so you know whether an
.Ic nomad upgrade
will pull new code or re-pull the image you already have.
.Pp
It is read-only. It queries the public GitHub Actions API for the most recent
admin-image build and inspects the locally deployed image's revision label, then
prints the
.Li origin/main
HEAD, the latest completed build revision, and the deployed image revision,
followed by a verdict: a build is still running
.Pq wait ,
the deployed image already matches the latest build
.Pq up to date ,
or the latest build is complete and ready to pull. No image is pulled and no
container is recreated.
.Pp
Proxy and
.Nm nomad
script changes ship via
.Ic nomad update
and never require an image build; this command concerns only the admin image
deployed by
.Ic nomad upgrade .
.Pp
.Ic nomad build-status
is an alias for this command.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic nomad build-check
Show admin-image build readiness before running
.Ic nomad upgrade .
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nomad 1 ,
.Xr nomad-upgrade 1 ,
.Xr nomad-update 1
